  "historyNote": "#8109, eff 6-24-04; ss by #10176, eff 8-23-12 (from Saf-C 1010.12); ss by #13685, eff 8-5-23 (formerly Saf-C 1011.10; ss by #14504, EMERGENCY, eff 2-6-26, EXPIRED: 8-5-26; reverted back to #13685",
